ucabled (0.2.0~) unstable; urgency=medium

  The Debian package is now split into three: ucabled (the system daemon),
  ucable-agent (the default GTK4 session agent and its helper) and
  ucabled-gnome-agent (the GNOME Shell agent extension).

  apt installs ucable-agent automatically through ucabled's Recommends.
  If you used the GNOME Shell extension that earlier versions shipped in
  the ucabled package, install ucabled-gnome-agent and enable it per user:

      gnome-extensions enable ucabled-agent@fuzy.me

 -- Zhengyi Fu <i@fuzy.me>  Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:15:19 +0800
